        "main": true,
        "title": "Triple Collagen™ – Advanced Collagen Support for Skin, Hair & Joints",
        "meta_descr": "Triple Collagen™ combines three collagen sources with vitamin C, hyaluronic acid, and botanicals to support healthy-looking skin, stronger hair and nails, joint comfort, hydration, and overall connective-tissue wellness.",
        "header_custom": "",
