          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div><div><b>Triple Collagen™</b> is designed to provide daily nutritional support for collagen-related tissues throughout the body. By combining multiple collagen sources with complementary nutrients such as vitamin C, hyaluronic acid, and botanical extracts, the formula is positioned as a comprehensive beauty and connective-tissue wellness supplement.</div><div><br></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Healthy-Looking Skin–</b>&nbsp;Collagen is an important structural component of the skin. Providing collagen peptides as part of a balanced diet may help support the skin’s normal structure and contribute to a smoother, firmer, and more youthful-looking appearance.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Promotes Skin Hydration –</b>&nbsp;Triple Collagen™ includes hyaluronic acid, a naturally occurring compound known for its ability to retain moisture. This makes it a complementary ingredient for supporting hydrated, supple, and healthy-looking skin.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Skin Elasticity&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;As the body naturally produces less collagen with age, maintaining adequate nutritional support becomes increasingly important. Triple Collagen™ provides collagen peptides that can complement the body's normal processes involved in maintaining skin structure and elasticity.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">✅<b>Supports Hair and Nail Health</b></span><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;–</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Collagen provides amino acids that the body uses in normal protein-related processes, while ingredients such as horsetail and bamboo extracts complement the formula's beauty-support focus. Regular nutritional support may help maintain stronger-looking nails and healthier-looking hair.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Joint and Cartilage Wellness&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;Collagen is naturally found in cartilage and connective tissues. The inclusion of hydrolyzed chicken cartilage alongside other collagen sources makes Triple Collagen™ suitable for people looking to support normal joint and connective-tissue wellness as part of an active lifestyle.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Provides Multiple Sources of Collagen&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;One of the distinguishing features of Triple Collagen™ is its combination of bovine, marine, and chicken-derived collagen sources. Using multiple sources provides a broader variety of collagen peptides and amino acids within one convenient daily formula.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Normal Collagen Formation&nbsp;–</b>Vitamin C is an important complementary nutrient because it contributes to normal collagen formation. This helps make it a useful addition to a formula centered around collagen and connective-tissue support.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">✅<b>Supports Overall Connective-Tissue Wellness–</b>&nbsp;Collagen is widely distributed throughout the body's connective tissues. By supplying collagen peptides together with complementary nutrients, Triple Collagen™ provides nutritional support for maintaining healthy connective tissues, skin, cartilage, and other structural components.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Convenient Daily Beauty Support–</b>Triple Collagen™ offers a simple way to incorporate collagen peptides and complementary nutrients into a regular wellness routine. Consistent use alongside a nutritious diet, adequate hydration, quality sleep, and regular activity can help support overall beauty and wellness goals.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
